# 本地开发用：DSH 源码检出（约 114MB，仅供本机对照官方 API）
# 它不属于本分发包的内容，别人 clone 应自行获取。
work/

# 历史调试残留（备份/损坏副本），不该随包分发
*.bak-*
*.bak_*
*.CORRUPTED-*
_sync_backup/
%SystemDrive%/

# ── 运行时状态（每台机器/每次任务都不同，绝不能进仓库）────────────────
# 这些文件由门禁脚本在运行时写入，包含本机路径、当前任务、房间状态等。
# 提交它们会导致别人 clone 后拿到"上一局"的残留状态（实测会误判任务已完成）。
engineering/tools/mode_state.json
engineering/tools/workflow_state.json
engineering/tools/sw_state.json
engineering/tools/connection_state.json
engineering/tools/platform_status.json
engineering/tools/platform_agents.json
engineering/tools/artifacts_registry*.json
engineering/tools/part_registry.json
engineering/tools/design_params.json
engineering/tools/custom_materials.json
engineering/tools/settings.json
engineering/tools/model_chain.json
engineering/tools/persona.json
engineering/tools/TASK_FINISHED.json
engineering/tools/defense_bypass.json
engineering/tools/violations.json
engineering/tools/guard.json
engineering/tools/sw_monitor.pid

# 根目录的少量运行时残留（历史布局遗留）
tools/mode_state.json
tools/workflow_state.json
tools/sw_state.json
tools/sw_monitor.pid

# 运行时目录：报告/心跳/锁/物理运行产物/凭据
engineering/tools/reports/
engineering/tools/heartbeats/
engineering/tools/load_cases/
engineering/tools/physics_runs/
engineering/tools/mode_logs/
engineering/tools/.defense/
engineering/output/

# 交付产物（零件/图纸/截图）不随代码分发
engineering/examples/
engineering/*.SLDPRT
engineering/*.png
*.SLDPRT
*.SLDASM
*.SLDDRW
*.dwg

# 临时/校验残留（⚠️ 不能用 "_*" 通配：会误伤正式模块
#   tools/_plugin_paths.py、_root.py、_store.py —— 它们是被 14 处引用的真代码）
_verify_*/
_tmp_*/
_*.txt
_*.log
*.tmp
